      "type": "text",
      "id": "t14",
      "text": "Authenticates to the primary via a secret scope. EXPORT phase wears the EAST identity to read the source;\nIMPORT phase wears the local WEST identity to write. Engine = native (MLflow APIs + SDK). Baseline once, then incremental CDC.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Authenticates to the primary via a secret scope. EXPORT phase wears the EAST identity to read the source;\nIMPORT phase wears the local WEST identity to write. Engine = native (MLflow APIs + SDK). Baseline once, then incremental CDC.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
